      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `model_client.py` file, I need to write code that sets up a client for interacting with a managed model platform. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service as an example, as it is a concrete managed model platform. The code will include importing the necessary SDK, setting up the client with configuration, and providing a helper function to interact with the model. </thinking>\n",
